Changes: this package keeps a subset of the SRD 5.2 (classes, species,
backgrounds, feats, equipment, skills and conditions), restructured as typed
data. Two values differ from the compilation it was imported from, to match the
SRD 5.2: Hide Armor is Medium Armor, and a Human's size is Medium or Small (see
CORRECTIONS in scripts/import.ts).

5e-bits

The data was imported from the JSON compilation in 5e-bits/5e-srd-api
(packages/5e-database/src/2024/en, at the commit in src/source.ts):

